00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:26.667
<v Dariusz Pennyworth-Hale>It's four eight nine two zero nine six two six.

00:00:26.867 --> 00:00:30.267
<v Eamon Muldowney>Thank you. So that's ACCT-489209626?

00:00:30.467 --> 00:00:32.133
<v Dariusz Pennyworth-Hale>That's it.

00:00:32.333 --> 00:00:37.933
