00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:10.800
<v Dariusz Pennyworth-Hale>Sorry. It's just, this is the third time I've rung, and I've only just gone back to work after being signed off for months with my nerves, so money's tight.

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:21.467
<v Eamon Muldowney>I completely understand. Okay, so I'm looking at the charges now. I see 3.1 million dollars on the fourth, and again on the fifth, and then...

00:01:21.667 --> 00:01:24.067
<v Dariusz Pennyworth-Hale>And then another one.

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:27.733
<v Eamon Muldowney>And then another one, yep, for $8.3M.

00:01:27.933 --> 00:01:30.600
