00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:26.867
<v Eamon Muldowney>Okay. Hmm. So, between us, we've had a few of these this week. There was a problem with our payment system that charged some people for add-ons they never picked, and the team's still working out how many.

00:02:27.067 --> 00:02:30.400
